{
  "_note": "PROVISIONAL thresholds, set before the first measurement (openspec/specs/spelling-eval). Rates are fractions; corruption is per 10,000 correct words; latency in ms. \"tolerance\" is how much worse than the baseline a value may get before eval:check fails. Criteria marked \"gate\" decide whether auto-replace may be on by default. Scopes: clean = clean datasets, misspelled = typos and injected datasets, all = every committed dataset. Criteria with \"compare\": false (instability, latency) vary with machine load: they are judged against their threshold but not compared with the baseline. \"instability\" is decision instability (flag or auto-replacement); suggestion instability is reported without a criterion.",
